    "tc_workshop_7": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_1": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>15. PROCESS FOR NOTIFYING US OF DAMAGE</strong></p><p>15.1 In the event that you wish to notify us of any damage to your product, please follow the following process:</p><p>15.1.1 If applicable, photograph damage to the protective wrapping before removing it;</p><p>15.1.2 Photograph the damage to the relevant product;</p><p>15.1.3 Provide us with details of how the product has been stored and/or used. Once notified of damage, we shall review the product and the alleged damage and whether you can claim under the warranty in paragraph 14.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_2": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>16. WE CAN CHANGE PRODUCTS AND THESE TERMS</strong></p><p>We can always change a product:</p><p>16.1.1 to reflect changes in relevant laws and regulatory requirements; or</p><p>16.1.2 to make minor technical adjustments and improvements, for example to address a safety issue. These are changes that don't affect your use of the product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_3": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>17. WE CAN END OUR CONTRACT WITH YOU</strong></p><p>17.1 We can end our contract with you for a product and claim any compensation due to us (including enforcement costs) if:</p><p>17.1.1 you don't make any payment to us when it's due and you still don't make payment within 7 days of our reminding you that payment is due;</p><p>17.1.2 you don't, within a reasonable time of us asking for it, provide us with information, cooperation or access that we need to provide the product;</p><p>17.1.3 you don't, within a reasonable time, either allow us to deliver the product to you or collect it from us; and/or</p><p>17.1.4 you breach any applicable third party terms and conditions that may apply to the product.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_1",
        "text_2",
